About:

An attempt to incorporate my dice_restart patch into the oagertz patch, which makes use of dice.

It boils down to adapting two files: init_part.f90 and read_param.f90.

The strategy is to insert the missing snippets into these two from the corresponding files in oagertz/dice. Some other adjustements in init_part.f90 will be necessary, such as:

		- updating zp
		- readining in nmetals (rather than one only)
		- reading in stellar birth masses
